OL,3,GNEWSASister condemns 'sickening' racist
OL,4,Aattack on siblings
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe sister of two people injured in an
OL,7,Fattack in Londonderry, which police are
OL,8,Ftreating as racially-motivated, has
OL,9,Fdescribed the ordeal as "sickening",
OL,10,Fsaying it has left their family deeply
OL,11,Fshaken.
OL,13,FThe woman, who does not wish to be
OL,14,Fnamed in order to protect the
OL,15,Fidentities of her brother and sister,
OL,16,Fsaid they were subjected to racial
OL,17,Fabuse before being attacked by a group
OL,18,Fof men, one of whom was armed with a
OL,19,Fbaton.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,416,410,260,120,0,100
