OL,3,GNEWSASister condemns 'sickening' racist
OL,4,Aattack on siblings
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice said they are investigating
OL,7,Fthree assaults and an incident of
OL,8,Fcriminal damage in the Waterside area
OL,9,Fof the city on Sunday night.
OL,11,FThey believe all three incidents may be
OL,12,Flinked and are treating them as
OL,13,Fracially-motivated hate crimes.
